{
  "name": "jp.co.cri-mw.spritestudio.ssplayer-unity",
  "version": "7.0.0-beta.1",
  "displayName": "SpriteStudio Player for Unity",
  "description": "High-performance player for SpriteStudio animations (.ssab). Renders in world space (MeshRenderer) and on a uGUI Canvas (CanvasRenderer), with an asset pipeline that converts .sspj at import time. Playback is driven by a native Rust runtime over FFI, with geometry built in Burst jobs and uploaded with no per-frame GC allocations.",
